\subsection{Web-Environment Deep-Research Harness}

The deep-research evaluation uses a thinking-enabled ReAct policy with at most
64 search-and-read steps. Search queries are issued through Serper with Jina
Search as a fallback, and pages are extracted through Jina Reader. Retrieved
material is summarized by \zgcm{} operating in direct-response (no-thinking)
